    {
      "name": "on_envelope",
      "docs": [
        "The only entry for orders: called by the envelope program, signed by the line's authority PDA.",
        "Accounts after the four named ones: the escrows (one per content escrow), then, supplied by the cranker and",
        "checked here by key: pool, base_vault, quote_vault, lp_mint, base_mint, quote_mint, owner, owner_base,",
        "owner_quote, owner_lp (the owner's associated accounts), token program, associated token program, system program.",
        "A wrong account is an error (a retry with the right ones cures it); the content decides only the verdict."
      ],
